+// ---- GCC range designators (`[lo ... hi] = value`) -------------------------
+// GCC accepts `[lo ... hi] = value` in initializer lists to initialize a *range*
+// of array elements with the same value, e.g.
+//     struct S s = { .a[0 ... MAX_OPERANDS - 1] = -1 };
